# Vectored machine software interrupt from the MSIP device.
# Host setup preloads:
# - MSIP pending in the machine software interrupt device
# - mstatus.MIE and mie.MSIE enabled
# - mtvec = 0x40 in vectored mode
# Handler at 0x4c clears MSIP, records x10 = 3, and returns with mret.
# Expect x10 = 3, mcause = interrupt 3, mepc = 0, pc = 0.
